=2 Notes
After visiting your {p:Mog Garden} for 19 different Earth days, you will be cleared on the 20th day for this quest. Having 20 stars on your {k:GPS crystal} might not necessarily be enough as you can obtain extra stars during certain campaigns. You must still enter the Mog Garden on 20 separate Earth days. You can see how many days you've visited the Mog Garden by speaking to your {n:Green Thumb Moogle}, asking to "Learn about the Mog Garden" and selecting "Tidbits of information."
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with the {n:Green Thumb Moogle} for a dialogue, initiating this quest.
* Obtain and trade your {n:Green Thumb Moogle} a {@i:Moat Carp Creel|5810} {i:Moat Carp Creel|Moat Carp Creel|5810}, a {@i:Date|5566} {i:Date|Date|5566}, and a {@i:Gnatbane|5984} {i:Gnatbane|Gnatbane|5984}.
** {i:Gnatbane|Gnatbane|5984} is a slightly rare result of harvesting {i:Herb Seeds|Herb Seeds|572} or {i:Arborscent Seed|Arborscent Seed|3982} in the {p:Garden Furrow}. No fertilizer is required.
** {i:Date|Date|5566} can be harvested as a result of {i:Cactus Stems|Cactus Stems|1236}. No fertilizer is required.
** {i:Moat Carp Creel|Moat Carp Creel|5810} can be obtained from the **Pond Dredger**. Using a {i:Super Baitball|Super Baitball|4005} may increase your odds of obtaining this.
*** Another easy way to get a {i:Moat Carp Creel|Moat Carp Creel|5810} is to do {p:Moblin Maze Mongers} {i:Maze Voucher 08|Maze Voucher 08|28743} Aquatic Depopulation Team and pick Claraisse after you win.
* Trade the three items to the {n:Green Thumb Moogle} and he will say to come back in a day or so.
* Wait one game day and zone back into your {p:Mog Garden}. A cutscene will start as you zone in.
* After the cutscene speak to your {n:Green Thumb Moogle} to complete the quest and receive your {@i:Hoe|20909} {i:Hoe|Hoe|20909}.

